ry for what it is  um before they like give up because a  lot of times like you'll have like a  premiere of something you have people  watching the first episode but then they  won't come back the next week but with  something like foundation which is very  much about the long view of history  maybe three episodes is appropriate to  get people hooked it's more like a long  movie um it's very very very exciting  like i always say um  i'm really happy that classic science  fiction is being adapted right now we  have found a foundation television show  that i never dreamed that they would  make and we've got this awesome  dinnerville no dune movie that's coming  up that i never dreamed would look this  good either so it's just very exciting  for me as someone that loves these books  and hopefully hyperion is next i think  that is a  book series that is so ready to be made  into a tv show it lends itself to the tv  show like format i think uh better than  a lot of other sci-fi stuff does  but not to ramble on for too long if you  want to see the foundation trailer link  in the description  please leave a like and subscribe for  more science fiction lore content thank  you guys so much peace out  you

